 \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of 0, equals 3\"></span></span>, which of the following defines <span class=\"italic\">f</span>?</p>\n","answer":{"style":"Multiple Choice","choices":{"a":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, three fourths x, minus 3\"></span></span></p>\n"},"b":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, three fourths x, plus 3\"></span></span></p>\n"},"c":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, 4 x, minus 3\"></span></span></p>\n"},"d":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, 4 x, plus 3\"></span></span></p>\n"}},"correct_choice":"b","rationale":"<p>Choice B is correct. The equation for the function <span class=\"italic\">f</span> in the <span class=\"italic\">xy</span>-plane can be represented by <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, m x plus b\"></span>, where <span class=\"italic\">m</span> is the slope and <span class=\"italic\">b</span> is the <span class=\"italic\">y</span>-coordinate of the <span class=\"italic\">y</span>-intercept. Since it&rsquo;s given that the line has a slope of <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"three fourths\"></span>, it follows that <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"m equals three fourths \"></span> in <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, m x plus b\"></span>, which yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"y equals, three fourths x, plus b\"></span>. It&rsquo;s given that <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of 0 equals 3\"></span>. This implies that the graph of the function <span class=\"italic\">f</span> in the <span class=\"italic\">xy</span>-plane passes through the point <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"with coordinates 0 comma 3\"></span>. Thus, the <span class=\"italic\">y</span>-coordinate of the <span class=\"italic\">y</span>-intercept of the graph is 3, so <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"b equals 3\"></span> in <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, three fourths x, plus b\"></span>, which yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, three fourths x, plus 3\"></span>. Therefore, the equation <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, three fourths x, plus 3\"></span> defines the function <span class=\"italic\">f. </span><p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from a sign error for the <span class=\"italic\">y</span>-intercept. Choice C is incorrect and may result from using the denominator of the given slope as <span class=\"italic\">m</span> in <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, m x plus b\"></span>, in addition to a sign error for the <span class=\"italic\">y</span>-intercept. Choice D is incorrect and may result from using the denominator of the given slope as <span class=\"italic\">m</span> in <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, m x plus b\"></span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959625,"updateDate":1691007959625}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959625, 1691007959625),
