mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. What is the&nbsp;<em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math>?</p>","type":"mcq","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1730147357389,"updateDate":1730147357389}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1730147357389, 1730147357389),
    ($SATQ$317e80f9$SATQ$, $SATQ$f0975e35-afbb-4d74-9091-7a06a2bf4d03$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$63fbfbeb-d7f4-484d-a54e-b1484140ac15$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Algebra$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, $SATQ$H.D.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Systems of two linear equations in two variables$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: center;"><math alttext="x plus y equals 18"><mrow>
